# inline block above (and the risk that comes with editing a 2000-line
# literal), the Italian strings live here and are merged into ``_COMMON``,
# ``_TOOLS``, ``_LEGACY_PHRASE_MAP`` and ``_STATUS_MAP`` at import time.
#
# Parity with the other locales is enforced by
# ``tests/test_messages_i18n_parity.py`` — every (tool_id, key) present in
# Spanish must also exist in it/en/fr/de.
# ===========================================================================

