# HUB and OPS channels plus safe API errors. Job titles (Ops Supervisor,
# Shift Manager, Area Manager), the Owners NS/AM table (headers and metric
# names) and the "N/A" sentinel stay untranslated as operational terms. The
# Spanish Slack copy is kept byte-for-byte identical to the legacy output.
# Custom MENSAJE_AM / MENSAJE_PM workbook templates take precedence and are
# never translated.
