# FTDS/RTS (pm.ftds_rts runner + /api/ftds routes): runner results/warnings,
# Cortex fetch statuses and safe route errors. Registered additively on top
# of the base ``pm.ftds_rts`` email block. Product names (FTDS, RTS,
# Harmony, PerfectMile, Mercury, Cortex, PHR, DSC), data tokens (tracking
# id, transporter ID) and machine sentinels stay untranslated; env var
# names (ALLOWED_DSPS, BASE_*_TB, CORTEX_SERVICE_AREA_ID, SLACK_*/EMAIL_*)
# no longer appear in user-facing copy. Slack composers are NOT keyed here:
# they stay Spanish and are translated at send/preview time via
# ``translate_message`` (legacy phrase map).
